  'privacyConnected.title': 'Using Styld through ChatGPT or Claude',
  'privacyConnected.data':
    'When you use Styld in an AI host such as ChatGPT or Claude, that host sends the tool requests you choose to Styld. Results can include your selected wardrobe details, board contents, profile information and images needed to display a card. Photos you ask the host to add are copied into your Styld account. Public browsing is available without an account on supported hosts. Styld does not receive your entire conversation through this connection.',
  'privacyConnected.scopes':
    'Linking uses OAuth, so your Styld password is not shared with the host. The consent screen lists the requested permissions: styld:read reads your data and styld:write permits changes and eligible paid actions; identity scopes can provide account identity, and offline_access permits token refresh. Tools that run Styld’s AI retain the membership and credit checks.',
  'privacyConnected.revoke':
    'You can revoke access in Account → Connected agents. Revocation prevents new requests with that grant; it does not erase results already held in the host’s conversation history. The host processes and retains those results under its own privacy policy and account settings. Styld records connection and tool-usage events to operate and improve the service.',
